      "traditional": "一天，老師讓大家寫文章，文章是《如果我是一位經理》。",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān lǎo shī ràng dà jiā xiě wén zhāng wén zhāng shì rú guǒ wǒ shì yí wèi jīng lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "One day the teacher made everyone write an essay on the topic “If I was a manager”."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "大家都开始写了，只有小明没有写，在那儿东看看西看看。",
      "traditional": "大家都開始寫了，只有小明沒有寫，在那兒東看看西看看。",
      "pinyin": "dà jiā dōu kāi shǐ xiě le zhǐ yǒu xiǎo míng méi yǒu xiě zài nà'r dōng kàn kan xī kàn kan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "老师问：“小明，你为什么不写？”",
      "traditional": "老師問：“小明，你為什麼不寫？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī wèn xiǎo míng nǐ wèi shén me bù xiě",
      "english": "Everyone started to write except for Little Ming. He just sat there looking around."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明说：“我在等我的秘书。因为经理的文章都是秘书帮写的。”",
      "traditional": "小明說：“我在等我的秘書。因為經理的文章都是秘書幫寫的。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng shuō wǒ zài děng wǒ de mì shū yīn wèi jīng lǐ de wén zhāng dōu shì mì shū bāng xiě de",
      "english": "The teacher asked: “Little Ming, why aren't you writing?”"
    }
  ],
